    "title": "DELITOON AR : Arabic Comics",
    "description": "Get ready for an exceptional and enjoyable journey with Beltone, your gateway to a world of webtoon stories in Arabic. Immerse yourself in a carefully selected collection of official, copyrighted Arabic webtoon stories and original content, carefully designed to meet your refined tastes.\r\n\r\n Premium content: Experience the art of narrative at its peak with our distinguished collection of official and copyrighted Arabic webtoon stories, which provide a unique and rich experience.\r\n\r\n FREE GLIMPSE: Enjoy the initial episodes of each webtoon story for free, to get a glimpse of the special before immersing yourself in the full narrative. \r\n\r\n .GLOBAL COMMUNITY: Join a vibrant community of Arab readers around the world, all connected by their shared appreciation for the unique and exciting narrative we offer exclusively.\r\n\r\n  Calling Creators: Aspiring creatives can join our program, where they can turn their artistic visions into reality. Be a part of Belton's story and share your creativity with the audience\r\n\r\n Download now and immerse yourself in the world of Belton! The first official Arabic webtoon service, where every story is a painting waiting to be explored",
